{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你是双语翻译审核员。逐条比较英文 source 与中文 target，判断是否存在客观、实质性的翻译缺陷。\n\n规则：\n\n1. 只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题；不要依赖外部知识、仓库记忆、猜测或风格偏好。\n2. 若条目包含 source_context，可把它作为与 source 同等有效的源码证据；若没有，则只能使用 source 与 target。\n3. 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。\n4. FINDING 表示证据足以确定存在缺陷；UNCERTAIN 仅用于证据指向问题但仍有真实歧义；没有可报告的客观问题时 candidates 为空数组。\n5. 一个条目可报告多个相互独立的候选。不要因为发现一个问题而停止检查，也不要让错误候选抵消正确候选。\n6. 每个候选的 target_span 必须逐字出现在 target 中；evidence 必须逐字出现在 source，或在该条目存在时逐字出现在 source_context 中。\n7. 保持输入顺序和 neutral_id 完全不变。严格输出符合给定 schema 的 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或额外说明。\n\n缺陷类型：VALUE、DIRECTION、CONDITION、SUBJECT、REFERENT、TIMING、SCOPE、ACTION、STATE、ORDER、OMISSION、ADDITION、OTHER。\n\n输出 JSON Schema（逐字遵守）：\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 20,\n      \"maxItems\": 20,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"neutral_id\", \"candidates\", \"observation\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"neutral_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^Q[0-9]{3}$\"},\n          \"candidates\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"claim_type\", \"target_span\", \"correction\", \"evidence\"],\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"FINDING\", \"UNCERTAIN\"]},\n                \"claim_type\": {\"enum\": [\"VALUE\", \"DIRECTION\", \"CONDITION\", \"SUBJECT\", \"REFERENT\", \"TIMING\", \"SCOPE\", \"ACTION\", \"STATE\", \"ORDER\", \"OMISSION\", \"ADDITION\", \"OTHER\"]},\n                \"target_span\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"correction\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"observation\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n输入 JSON：\n{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-a-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q041\",\"source\":\"Accept these selections\",\"target\":\"确认法术选择\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q042\",\"source\":\"Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.\",\"target\":\"到达无尽地下城第10层。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q043\",\"source\":\"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\",\"target\":\"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q044\",\"source\":\"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\",\"target\":\"让淤泥巢穴中的 200 面墙变成敌对生物。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q045\",\"source\":\"But what is all th...\",\"target\":\"但是这一切到底是……\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q046\",\"source\":\"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\",\"target\":\"杀死一名厄运行者。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q047\",\"source\":\"#{italic}#A few tattered scraps of paper lie on the ground, ruined from your fight with the creature carrying it.  It's almost completely illegible, but you can piece some of it together to read:#{normal}#\\n\\\"...pheromone signals effective on much Eyalite wildlife ineffective on species 'sun paladin.'  at current planetary core cooling rates, passive study would lead to great loss - next step of emigration program should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\\\"\",\"target\":\"#{italic}#地上有一些破烂的纸片，看来在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了。纸片上的文字几乎完全无法辨认，你只能依稀拼凑出一些文字：#{normal}#\\n“…对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在‘太阳骑士’这种物种的身上被证明无效。在当前的行星核心冷却速率下，被动的研究会导致巨大的损失——移民计划的下一步是清理本地的“太阳骑士”巢穴并建立…”\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q048\",\"source\":\"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three\",\"target\":\"博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q049\",\"source\":\"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.#WHITE#\",\"target\":\"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示。#WHITE#\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q050\",\"source\":\"#{italic}#(You see here a large, elaborate fountain.  A statue of Linaniil stands in the center, her arms outstretched to welcome all; around the outside of the fountain stand statues of a dwarf manipulating earthen runes, a human with a simple healer's crosier, an elf with a tall, elaborate staff, and a halfling with a scepter in one hand and a fireball hovering over the other.  The runes and the fireball are not connected to anything, and float in a fixed position in the air.  You see a carving repeating along the border of the fountain, in small print.)#{normal}#\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO LEARN FROM THE MISTAKES OF THE PAST\\n\\nLET THE ARCANE ONCE MORE BE A BOON AND NOT A BANE TO MAJ'EYAL\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO EASE THE SUFFERING OF THE PRESENT\\n\\nMAY WE HAVE THE WISDOM TO ONE DAY REUNITE THE WORLD IN SAFETY AND ENLIGHTENMENT\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO PREVENT THE THREATS OF THE FUTURE\\n\\nGATHER HERE IN PEACE TO DISCOVER AND PERFECT THE KNOWLEDGE OF HOW, AND WHEN, TO WEAVE THE WORLD'S FABRIC\",\"target\":\"#{italic}#（你在此看到一座位于德斯镇、庞大而精致的喷泉。莱娜尼尔的雕像站在中央，她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人；喷泉外缘周围站着几座雕像：一名操纵大地符文的矮人，一名持简朴治疗师权杖的人类，一名持高大精巧法杖的精灵，以及一名一手握着权杖、另一手上方悬浮火球的半身人。那些符文与火球未与任何东西相连，却保持在空中的固定位置。你看见喷泉边缘反复雕着一行细小字样。）#{normal}#\\n\\n欢迎所有从过去的错误中吸取教训之人\\n\\n愿奥术再度成为马基·埃亚尔的助益，而非灾祸\\n\\n欢迎所有缓解当下苦难之人\\n\\n愿我们拥有智慧，终有一日在安全与启蒙中使世界重新团结\\n\\n欢迎所有阻止未来威胁之人\\n\\n在此和平相聚，探索并完善何时、如何编织世界织物的知识\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q051\",\"source\":\"Then you are at the right place, for I am an expert jeweler.\\nIf you bring me a gem and a ring, I can create a new ring imbued with the properties of the gem.  The original traits of the ring will be lost in the process but new ones of similar quality will be generated.\\nThere is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring, and you need a quality ring to use a quality gem.\",\"target\":\"你算找对地方了，我可是一个珠宝专家。\\n如果你给我找来一颗宝石和一枚项链，我可以帮你把宝石的力量镶嵌到戒指里去。这颗戒指里面原来所有的属性会丢失掉，不过也会生成一些质量相似的新属性。\\n不过根据戒指等级我要收取一小笔费用。你得寻找高品质的戒指来用于高品质的宝石。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q052\",\"source\":\"But then where are they now if they won?\",\"target\":\"兽人是胜利了，但是现在他们又在哪里呢？\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q053\",\"source\":\"Fear not. Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared. Oh, take this. #LIGHT_GREEN#*He hands you a key*#WHITE# It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago. If you happen to find a text in the ruins entitled \\\"Inverted and Reverted Probabilistic Fields\\\", return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically.\",\"target\":\"别害怕，几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了。哦，带上这个。 #LIGHT_GREEN#*他交给你一把钥匙。*#WHITE#它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。要是你在废墟之中找到一份标题是《反转与复原概率场》的文献，请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q054\",\"source\":\"I cleared the room of death and all I got was this lousy achievement!\",\"target\":\"我清完“死亡之屋”后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q055\",\"source\":\"The Right thing to do\",\"target\":\"放走鲜血大师才是正确的选择\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q056\",\"source\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*You suddenly realize everything has turned dark.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You look around searching for your rival. And then you notice it. Standing\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#right before you, a massive battle armor with an equally massive battle axe.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#It wasn't there just a second ago. You step back and examine him better,\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#realizing it's actually a human inside that hulking, worn armor. You can't see\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#his eyes, but you know he's piercing your soul with his stare*\\nf...t...ma....ll...\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You hear a devilish voice, coming from everywhere at once!! But...you are\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#unable to understand anything! It doesn't seem like any language used in\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#Maj'Eyal!\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#And then...a piercing, demonic roar...you are overwhelmed by extreme\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#emotions invading your very soul!!*\\n\",\"target\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你突然发现四周陷入了黑暗。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你环顾四周，寻找自己的对手。随即，你注意到了它：\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#一副同样手持巨大战斧的巨型战甲，就站在你面前。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#一瞬之前那里还空无一物。你后退一步，仔细端详，\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实装着弗莉吉亚的弟弟。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你看不见他的双眼，却知道他的目光正刺穿你的灵魂*\\n弗……特……玛……尔……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*一个魔鬼般的声音突然从四面八方同时传来！！但……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你完全听不懂！这不像\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#马基·埃亚尔使用的任何一种语言！\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#紧接着……一声刺耳的恶魔咆哮……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#极端的情绪侵入灵魂，将你彻底淹没！！*\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q057\",\"source\":\"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\",\"target\":\"重新加载/重新生成地图和角色\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q058\",\"source\":\"Lua inspect [Projectile]\",\"target\":\"即使此处没有抛射物，也可在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q059\",\"source\":\"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\",\"target\":\"必须单次使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q060\",\"source\":\"Killed oneself as a halfling.\",\"target\":\"选择半身人种族并杀死敌人。\"}]}"}],"timestamp":1787984146346}}
{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你是双语翻译审核员。逐条比较英文 source 与中文 target，判断是否存在客观、实质性的翻译缺陷。\n\n规则：\n\n1. 只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题；不要依赖外部知识、仓库记忆、猜测或风格偏好。\n2. 若条目包含 source_context，可把它作为与 source 同等有效的源码证据；若没有，则只能使用 source 与 target。\n3. 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。\n4. FINDING 表示证据足以确定存在缺陷；UNCERTAIN 仅用于证据指向问题但仍有真实歧义；没有可报告的客观问题时 candidates 为空数组。\n5. 一个条目可报告多个相互独立的候选。不要因为发现一个问题而停止检查，也不要让错误候选抵消正确候选。\n6. 每个候选的 target_span 必须逐字出现在 target 中；evidence 必须逐字出现在 source，或在该条目存在时逐字出现在 source_context 中。\n7. 保持输入顺序和 neutral_id 完全不变。严格输出符合给定 schema 的 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或额外说明。\n\n缺陷类型：VALUE、DIRECTION、CONDITION、SUBJECT、REFERENT、TIMING、SCOPE、ACTION、STATE、ORDER、OMISSION、ADDITION、OTHER。\n\n输出 JSON Schema（逐字遵守）：\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 20,\n      \"maxItems\": 20,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"neutral_id\", \"candidates\", \"observation\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"neutral_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^Q[0-9]{3}$\"},\n          \"candidates\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"claim_type\", \"target_span\", \"correction\", \"evidence\"],\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"FINDING\", \"UNCERTAIN\"]},\n                \"claim_type\": {\"enum\": [\"VALUE\", \"DIRECTION\", \"CONDITION\", \"SUBJECT\", \"REFERENT\", \"TIMING\", \"SCOPE\", \"ACTION\", \"STATE\", \"ORDER\", \"OMISSION\", \"ADDITION\", \"OTHER\"]},\n                \"target_span\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"correction\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"observation\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n输入 JSON：\n{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-a-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q041\",\"source\":\"Accept these selections\",\"target\":\"确认法术选择\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q042\",\"source\":\"Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.\",\"target\":\"到达无尽地下城第10层。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q043\",\"source\":\"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\",\"target\":\"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q044\",\"source\":\"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\",\"target\":\"让淤泥巢穴中的 200 面墙变成敌对生物。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q045\",\"source\":\"But what is all th...\",\"target\":\"但是这一切到底是……\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q046\",\"source\":\"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\",\"target\":\"杀死一名厄运行者。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q047\",\"source\":\"#{italic}#A few tattered scraps of paper lie on the ground, ruined from your fight with the creature carrying it.  It's almost completely illegible, but you can piece some of it together to read:#{normal}#\\n\\\"...pheromone signals effective on much Eyalite wildlife ineffective on species 'sun paladin.'  at current planetary core cooling rates, passive study would lead to great loss - next step of emigration program should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\\\"\",\"target\":\"#{italic}#地上有一些破烂的纸片，看来在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了。纸片上的文字几乎完全无法辨认，你只能依稀拼凑出一些文字：#{normal}#\\n“…对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在‘太阳骑士’这种物种的身上被证明无效。在当前的行星核心冷却速率下，被动的研究会导致巨大的损失——移民计划的下一步是清理本地的“太阳骑士”巢穴并建立…”\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q048\",\"source\":\"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three\",\"target\":\"博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q049\",\"source\":\"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.#WHITE#\",\"target\":\"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示。#WHITE#\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q050\",\"source\":\"#{italic}#(You see here a large, elaborate fountain.  A statue of Linaniil stands in the center, her arms outstretched to welcome all; around the outside of the fountain stand statues of a dwarf manipulating earthen runes, a human with a simple healer's crosier, an elf with a tall, elaborate staff, and a halfling with a scepter in one hand and a fireball hovering over the other.  The runes and the fireball are not connected to anything, and float in a fixed position in the air.  You see a carving repeating along the border of the fountain, in small print.)#{normal}#\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO LEARN FROM THE MISTAKES OF THE PAST\\n\\nLET THE ARCANE ONCE MORE BE A BOON AND NOT A BANE TO MAJ'EYAL\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO EASE THE SUFFERING OF THE PRESENT\\n\\nMAY WE HAVE THE WISDOM TO ONE DAY REUNITE THE WORLD IN SAFETY AND ENLIGHTENMENT\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO PREVENT THE THREATS OF THE FUTURE\\n\\nGATHER HERE IN PEACE TO DISCOVER AND PERFECT THE KNOWLEDGE OF HOW, AND WHEN, TO WEAVE THE WORLD'S FABRIC\",\"target\":\"#{italic}#（你在此看到一座位于德斯镇、庞大而精致的喷泉。莱娜尼尔的雕像站在中央，她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人；喷泉外缘周围站着几座雕像：一名操纵大地符文的矮人，一名持简朴治疗师权杖的人类，一名持高大精巧法杖的精灵，以及一名一手握着权杖、另一手上方悬浮火球的半身人。那些符文与火球未与任何东西相连，却保持在空中的固定位置。你看见喷泉边缘反复雕着一行细小字样。）#{normal}#\\n\\n欢迎所有从过去的错误中吸取教训之人\\n\\n愿奥术再度成为马基·埃亚尔的助益，而非灾祸\\n\\n欢迎所有缓解当下苦难之人\\n\\n愿我们拥有智慧，终有一日在安全与启蒙中使世界重新团结\\n\\n欢迎所有阻止未来威胁之人\\n\\n在此和平相聚，探索并完善何时、如何编织世界织物的知识\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q051\",\"source\":\"Then you are at the right place, for I am an expert jeweler.\\nIf you bring me a gem and a ring, I can create a new ring imbued with the properties of the gem.  The original traits of the ring will be lost in the process but new ones of similar quality will be generated.\\nThere is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring, and you need a quality ring to use a quality gem.\",\"target\":\"你算找对地方了，我可是一个珠宝专家。\\n如果你给我找来一颗宝石和一枚项链，我可以帮你把宝石的力量镶嵌到戒指里去。这颗戒指里面原来所有的属性会丢失掉，不过也会生成一些质量相似的新属性。\\n不过根据戒指等级我要收取一小笔费用。你得寻找高品质的戒指来用于高品质的宝石。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q052\",\"source\":\"But then where are they now if they won?\",\"target\":\"兽人是胜利了，但是现在他们又在哪里呢？\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q053\",\"source\":\"Fear not. Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared. Oh, take this. #LIGHT_GREEN#*He hands you a key*#WHITE# It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago. If you happen to find a text in the ruins entitled \\\"Inverted and Reverted Probabilistic Fields\\\", return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically.\",\"target\":\"别害怕，几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了。哦，带上这个。 #LIGHT_GREEN#*他交给你一把钥匙。*#WHITE#它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。要是你在废墟之中找到一份标题是《反转与复原概率场》的文献，请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q054\",\"source\":\"I cleared the room of death and all I got was this lousy achievement!\",\"target\":\"我清完“死亡之屋”后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q055\",\"source\":\"The Right thing to do\",\"target\":\"放走鲜血大师才是正确的选择\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q056\",\"source\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*You suddenly realize everything has turned dark.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You look around searching for your rival. And then you notice it. Standing\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#right before you, a massive battle armor with an equally massive battle axe.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#It wasn't there just a second ago. You step back and examine him better,\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#realizing it's actually a human inside that hulking, worn armor. You can't see\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#his eyes, but you know he's piercing your soul with his stare*\\nf...t...ma....ll...\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You hear a devilish voice, coming from everywhere at once!! But...you are\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#unable to understand anything! It doesn't seem like any language used in\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#Maj'Eyal!\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#And then...a piercing, demonic roar...you are overwhelmed by extreme\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#emotions invading your very soul!!*\\n\",\"target\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你突然发现四周陷入了黑暗。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你环顾四周，寻找自己的对手。随即，你注意到了它：\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#一副同样手持巨大战斧的巨型战甲，就站在你面前。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#一瞬之前那里还空无一物。你后退一步，仔细端详，\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实装着弗莉吉亚的弟弟。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你看不见他的双眼，却知道他的目光正刺穿你的灵魂*\\n弗……特……玛……尔……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*一个魔鬼般的声音突然从四面八方同时传来！！但……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你完全听不懂！这不像\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#马基·埃亚尔使用的任何一种语言！\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#紧接着……一声刺耳的恶魔咆哮……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#极端的情绪侵入灵魂，将你彻底淹没！！*\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q057\",\"source\":\"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\",\"target\":\"重新加载/重新生成地图和角色\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q058\",\"source\":\"Lua inspect [Projectile]\",\"target\":\"即使此处没有抛射物，也可在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q059\",\"source\":\"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\",\"target\":\"必须单次使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q060\",\"source\":\"Killed oneself as a halfling.\",\"target\":\"选择半身人种族并杀死敌人。\"}]}"}],"timestamp":1787984146346}}
